cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I am not sure why North did not take the heart finesse. Once the heart finesse works even if hearts break 3-1, North can count 5 heart tricks, 5 spade tricks, 1 diamond trick, and a diamond ruff for 12 tricks. Now North made 11 tricks because he ended up losing the @HK. The best play is to lead the @HQ at trick 3.|
