UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Generally speaking this was an okay line of play. Another alternative is to play 2 rounds of diamonds first and then lead a spade to the queen and play 2 hearts to avoid an unnecessary ruff.|
