MB|?|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Now despite my 4 spades at this vulnerability I want to aggressively preempt. So I am bidding 3@H, although admittedly with 4 spades we could have a misfit. So it is a bit risky but at favorable vulnerability you want to be particularly aggressive when you have a preemptive hand.|
